From: Prospero Win contributors <prospero-win@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] user32: opt in to protocol-tagged shared window style

Derived from the shared-window-style prototype. Keep server authority and
ordinary fallback, select publication once under the server lock, reserve
at most eight mapping attempts atomically, and require the exact protocol
publication tag. Matching ntdll/server/win32u/user32 builds are mandatory.
No console performance acceptance is claimed by source/native checks.

